{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge cards. Outsmart threats. Survive the collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Net Raiders</i> is a single-player game that fuses Roguelike Deck-building, RPG elements, and Real-Time Strategy. Amidst the chaos of a crumbling virtual space, your choices determine your survival.  <br><strong>Merge</strong> cards in your hand in real-time to turn the tide of battle and break through ever-encroaching threats. In a world reconstructed with every run, combine cards, Chips, and items to perfect your ultimate deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Card Merge System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't like your hand? Then merge them! You can <strong>merge</strong> two cards in real-time during battle to turn the tables. Each card is assigned a specific <strong>Merge Type</strong>, and you can combine any cards that share the same <strong>Merge Type</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/bc19bd511968acdbac15a8f34d75f049.poster.avif?t=1769159784\" width=618 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/bc19bd511968acdbac15a8f34d75f049.webm?t=1769159784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/bc19bd511968acdbac15a8f34d75f049.mp4?t=1769159784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance Merge</strong> \u2013 Evolve your card's performance. Amplify effects or alter properties to unleash their full potential.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/b79a7de513f02112bec64e92a53dd269.poster.avif?t=1769159784\" width=618 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/b79a7de513f02112bec64e92a53dd269.webm?t=1769159784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/b79a7de513f02112bec64e92a53dd269.mp4?t=1769159784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supply Merge</strong> \u2013 Generate variables. Immediately draw a new card from the consumed slot to maintain momentum and seek endless opportunities. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/59bc65cb37ada542aa925260341722ae.poster.avif?t=1769159784\" width=618 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/59bc65cb37ada542aa925260341722ae.webm?t=1769159784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/59bc65cb37ada542aa925260341722ae.mp4?t=1769159784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform Merge</strong> \u2013 Turn crisis into opportunity. Convert unneeded cards into others in your hand to find the optimal strategy for the situation. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Condition-Based Card Effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/7a73d1edd3ddf7e80e25bb4518f847f6.poster.avif?t=1769159784\" width=618 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/7a73d1edd3ddf7e80e25bb4518f847f6.webm?t=1769159784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/7a73d1edd3ddf7e80e25bb4518f847f6.mp4?t=1769159784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/725022f6ee0ec696fb5331f82304eec7.poster.avif?t=1769159784\" width=618 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/725022f6ee0ec696fb5331f82304eec7.webm?t=1769159784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/725022f6ee0ec696fb5331f82304eec7.mp4?t=1769159784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple approaches won't work. Most cards unleash explosive power only when specific &quot;conditions&quot; are met. Meticulously design your deck and satisfy these conditions to maximize efficiency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Characters, Unique Decks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/1f83fa23042afc13a7ab997ea9a532f7.poster.avif?t=1769159784\" width=618 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/1f83fa23042afc13a7ab997ea9a532f7.webm?t=1769159784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/1f83fa23042afc13a7ab997ea9a532f7.mp4?t=1769159784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive characters, each with unique exclusive cards and special mechanisms, are ready for you. Collect Chips and items to unlock their potential and push your playstyle to the limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Experience Every Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Net Raiders</i> is reconstructed with every playthrough. Face changing cards, unpredictable events, and powerful enemies. Rise from countless failures and perfect your own &quot;Ultimate Strategy.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact - <a href=\"mailto:obliqoninc@gmail.com\">obliqoninc@gmail.com</a></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2520780?t=1769159784","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2520780?t=1769159784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/cde6632f58bc79bb7980062491c721820becaa16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769159784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/cde6632f58bc79bb7980062491c721820becaa16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769159784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2524430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge cards. Outsmart threats. Survive the collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Net Raiders</i> is a single-player game that fuses Roguelike Deck-building, RPG elements, and Real-Time Strategy. Amidst the chaos of a crumbling virtual space, your choices determine your survival.  <br><strong>Merge</strong> cards in your hand in real-time to turn the tide of ba